@engineering.yagni

Purpose:
  You aren't gonna need it.

UseWhen:
  - building for current requirements only
  - future needs are speculative
  - simplicity is preferred

AvoidWhen:
  - extension point is obvious and cheap
  - future need is highly probable

Why:
  Delaying complexity until it is needed reduces maintenance burden.

Related:
  @engineering.kiss
  @engineering.dry

Examples:
  @project.startup
  @project.mvp

State: +
